## 两个模式下，模型看到的 tools JSON 完全不同

**普通模式：**
```json
[
  { "name": "read", "parameters": {...}, "description": "..." },
  { "name": "write", "parameters": {...}, "description": "写入或修改文件" },
  { "name": "exec", "parameters": {...}, ... },
  { "name": "bash", "parameters": {...}, ... },
  { "name": "edit", "parameters": {...}, ... },
  // 可能还有 30+ 个工具
]
```

**Memory flush 模式：**
```json
[
  { "name": "read", "parameters": {...}, "description": "..." },
  { "name": "write", "parameters": {...}, "description": "During memory flush, this tool may only append to memory/active.md." }
]
```

模型不只不知道路径限制——它**连 exec、bash 等工具的存在都不知道**。

---

## Wrapped write 的 execute 函数

```typescript
// agent-tools.read.ts
function wrapToolMemoryFlushAppendOnlyWrite(original, options) {
  const allowedAbsolutePath = path.resolve(options.root, options.relativePath);
  //                         ↑ 编译时计算：/workspace/memory/active.md

  return {
    ...original,
    description: `During memory flush, this tool may only append to ${options.relativePath}.`,
    parameters: {          // 改写了参数 schema
      path: "the target file path (must be " + options.relativePath + ")",
      content: "content to append",
    },
    execute: async (toolCallId, args, signal, onUpdate) => {
      const resolvedPath = resolveToolPathAgainstWorkspaceRoot({
        filePath: args.path,
        root: options.root,
      });
      // ── 路径硬校验 ──
      if (resolvedPath !== allowedAbsolutePath) {
        throw new Error(`Memory flush writes are restricted to ${options.relativePath}.`);
      }
      // ── 实际写入用 allowedAbsolutePath，不是模型传入的 path ──
      // ── 只追加，不覆盖 ──
      await appendMemoryFlushContent({
        absolutePath: allowedAbsolutePath,  // 硬编码
        content: args.content,
      });
    }
  };
}
```

**普通模式的 write execute：**
```typescript
execute: async (toolCallId, args) => {
  // 可以写入任意路径：/workspace/a.py, /workspace/readme.md, ...
  // 可以覆盖（content 全量写入）
}
```

